**4. Three public Data Science repositories**

- [IPL-Data-Analysis](https://github.com/tharaknath755-gif/IPL-Data-Analysis): `data/` holds raw and processed CSVs; `notebooks/` contains the IPL analysis notebook; `images/` stores charts. [Source](https://github.com/tharaknath755-gif/IPL-Data-Analysis)
- [Spotify analysis](https://github.com/gandhianaya/spotify-analysis): `scripts/0_data_extraction/` contains Spotify data scraping and merging notebooks; `scripts/1_data_preparation/` has cleaning and feature engineering; `scripts/2_clustering/` contains clustering analyses. [Source](https://github.com/gandhianaya/spotify-analysis)
- [Spotify music analysis](https://github.com/alexfunking/spotify-music-analysis): `data/` contains the track dataset; `notebooks/` has analysis notebooks; `src/` contains reusable analysis code. [Source](https://github.com/alexfunking/spotify-music-analysis)

